From 41e6a7afb59835aef8a95e978ca46384db7378cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brian Delwiche <delwiche@google.com>
Date: Thu, 14 May 2026 13:48:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] Remove btsec_sdp_database_thread_sync flag and old
 synchronization.

This change removes the feature flag btsec_sdp_database_thread_sync and
makes the thread synchronization logic for SDP database access the
default. The old recursive mutex-based synchronization is removed, and
all SDP operations now execute on the main thread using
DoInThreadSynchronously or are posted asynchronously to the main thread.

Test: mmm packages/modules/Bluetooth
Flag: EXEMPT FLAG_REMOVAL
Bug: 458487080
Bug: 415689442
Bug: 315241296
Change-Id: I3a4ac39b40753f8875ef3fceece4dbce67d594cd
(cherry picked from commit 1e06fed296f2e351f415ff7df3abd67fc96b4819)
